OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mainly dry but cloudy
OL,6,Fmorning. Outbreaks of rain will spread
OL,7,Facross from the west later in the
OL,8,Fafternoon, turning persistent and
OL,9,Foccasionally heavier later on.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FRain becomes widespread and
OL,12,Foccasionally heavy this evening,
OL,13,Fclearing east overnight. Most areas
OL,14,Fwill turn drier, though rain may
OL,15,Flinger over Buchan during the rest of
OL,16,Fthe night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
