OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FA risk of some early rain
OL,6,Fover Buchan. Otherwise a bright day
OL,7,Fwith some sunny spells in the morning
OL,8,Fthen showers developing in the
OL,9,Fafternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,12,FNortherly winds developing bringing a
OL,13,Frather chilly feel with scattered
OL,14,Fshowers, some possibly heavy on
OL,15,FWednesday and merging into a longer
OL,16,Fspell of rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
